										<li>Why 2D bitewing X-rays cannot see through porcelain or metal to detect cement leaks</li>
										<li>The clinical reality of the 48-72 hour delayed chemical fuse in oral pain</li>
										<li>A direct plea for interdisciplinary clinical trials uniting adhesive dentistry and ASIC receptor biology</li>
									</ol>
								</div>
